## Are there any implications of the People Over Wind judgment for undertaking an Environmental Impact Assessment?
No, the 
Environmental Impact Regulations (Town and Country Planning (Environmental Impact Assessment) Regulations 2017/571 (as amended))
 do allow for certain mitigation measures to be taken into account at the ‘screening stage’ for Environmental Impact Assessment.

